WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.633 --> 00:00:06.697
PongLens gives a table tennis coach one place to keep students, lessons and matches together.

2
00:00:09.747 --> 00:00:14.667
Add every student to one roster. They do not need a PongLens account to start.

3
00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:20.509
Open a student to see their lesson entries and the matches they have shared.

4
00:00:23.559 --> 00:00:29.319
When they are ready, send a private invite. It connects their account to the student you already know.

5
00:00:32.369 --> 00:00:37.025
After a session, write what you worked on, what to fix and what comes next.

6
00:00:38.375 --> 00:00:42.959
PongLens can turn rough notes into clear points, and keeps the original transcript with them.

7
00:00:46.009 --> 00:00:54.217
Lesson recording is on iPhone. Leave the phone near the table and PongLens prepares the entry afterwards. Video recording is coming soon.

8
00:00:57.267 --> 00:01:00.627
An entry stays private until you share it.

9
00:01:01.777 --> 00:01:06.817
Once shared, it appears in your student's PongLens journal. You can also send it as a link.

10
00:01:09.867 --> 00:01:14.835
The matches a student shares sit beside their lesson entries, ready to watch point by point.

11
00:01:17.885 --> 00:01:23.693
If you also sell remote match reviews, choose what each review covers, what it costs and how long you need.

12
00:01:24.743 --> 00:01:29.087
PongLens. Keep every student, lesson and match in one place.
